{"ID":"20240506105055-dlsmi2x","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240506105055-dlsmi2x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506105055-dlsmi2x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702125439-x1q7utx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613132721-6qqk0ip\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702125324-23vjrjx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"319莽草","type":"doc","updated":"20240902162030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240826172118-g6pm2k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826172118-g6pm2k7","updated":"20240826173406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240826173359-gu28wqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826173359-gu28wqe","updated":"20240826173401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 684px;","style":"width: 674px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 9-20240826171853-ljscz4z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 674px;\" parent-style=\"width: 684px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 11-20240826172008-a2fz90n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826172118-w8ihxsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826172118-w8ihxsf","updated":"20240826173408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 698px;","style":"width: 688px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 8-20240826171821-d5b8gi6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 688px;\" parent-style=\"width: 698px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 620px;","style":"width: 610px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 10-20240826171935-60l6ap1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 610px;\" parent-style=\"width: 620px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826172044-0c0sji5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826172044-0c0sji5","updated":"20240826172053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 301px;","style":"width: 291px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 5-20240826171611-2m4ttmk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 291px;\" parent-style=\"width: 301px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 326px;","style":"width: 316px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 6-20240826171650-52xztg2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 316px;\" parent-style=\"width: 326px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 682px;","style":"width: 672px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草2-20240702125853-9n7rvuq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 672px;\" parent-style=\"width: 682px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826171420-oj1h3ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826171420-oj1h3ro","updated":"20240826172058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 668px;","style":"width: 658px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 3-20240826171420-trlxnyc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 658px;\" parent-style=\"width: 668px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 7-20240826171732-vmkqseh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826171509-4k3p377","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826171509-4k3p377","updated":"20240826171515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 587px;","style":"width: 577px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草 4-20240826171509-t0p3hnw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 577px;\" parent-style=\"width: 587px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草3-20240702125901-2xd8qli.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240702130746-foxcqqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702130746-foxcqqf","updated":"20240826173419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 667px;","style":"width: 657px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莽草5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莽草5-20240702130746-hj3tbaa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 657px;\" parent-style=\"width: 667px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826172031-20b6sh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826172031-20b6sh4","updated":"20240826172031"}},{"ID":"20240724105802-ycekna9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724105802-ycekna9","updated":"20240724105806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"莽草、八角对比"}]},{"ID":"20240702125324-23vjrjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702125324-23vjrjx","updated":"20240702125358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 510px;","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"八角 莽草 对比图"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/八角 莽草 对比图-20240702125324-autb3y1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"width: 510px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 477px;","style":"width: 467px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"八角 莽草 对比图2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/八角 莽草 对比图2-20240702125358-7l4y0vv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 467px;\" parent-style=\"width: 477px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240613132717-xkebo0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132717-xkebo0a","updated":"20240902162030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：莽草跟八角茴香相似，注意甄别。点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240902161703-13fefsl","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"八角茴香（大茴香）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132717-l9wp5ry","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132717-l9wp5ry"}},{"ID":"20240613132801-il5lpim","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-il5lpim","updated":"20240613132805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-9icu85w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-9icu85w","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-nk5tdar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-nk5tdar","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风头痈肿，乳痈，疝瘕，除结气疥搔（《御览》有疽疮二字），杀虫鱼。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-8tafb1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-8tafb1y","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：莽草一名春草，神农辛，雷公桐君苦有毒，生上谷山谷中，或冤句，五月采，治风（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-35elm4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-35elm4z","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名葞，一名春草，生上谷及冤句，五月采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-adpz7du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-adpz7du","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《中山经》云：朝歌之山有草焉，名曰莽草，可以毒鱼，又山有木焉，其状如棠而赤，叶可以毒鱼，《尔雅》云：葞，春草。郭璞云：一名芒草。本草云：《周礼》云，翦氏掌除蠹物，以熏草莽之。《范子计然》云：莽草，出三辅者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132801-5bhmq06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132801-5bhmq06","updated":"20240613132801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶宏景云：字亦作两。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132835-bq9w8na","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132835-bq9w8na"}},{"ID":"20240613132836-i2deeuw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132836-i2deeuw","updated":"20240613132840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132836-29sw9ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132836-29sw9ln","updated":"20240613132836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草苦辛温有毒，头痒喉痹蛀牙风，瘰 诸疮皮肤痹，更消疝瘕杀鱼虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132836-1as8sg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132836-1as8sg3","updated":"20240613132836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生蜀中，似石南而叶稀，无花实，采之作椒气。治头风痒，可用沐，勿令入眼。疗喉痹不通，及蛀牙肿痛，浓煎汤，热含吐之，漱口勿咽。治瘰 结核坚肿，痈疽，乳难，乳痈未溃，头疡白秃，与白蔹、赤小豆为末，鸡子白调涂，干即易之。一切风疽，疝瘕，血凝肿坠，及风湿皮肤麻痹，煎汤淋洗，杀虫鱼，不入汤药。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132923-e2z6soh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132923-e2z6soh"}},{"ID":"20240613132924-dqk53it","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-dqk53it","updated":"20240613132944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-pg5ls1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-pg5ls1m","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，苦，温，有毒。主头风痈肿，乳痈疝瘕，除结气疥瘙。杀虫鱼。疗喉痹不通，乳难。头风痒，可用沐，勿令入眼。一名 ，一名春草。生上谷山谷及冤句。五月采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-8qy855n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-8qy855n","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今东间处处皆有，叶青新烈者良。人用捣以和米，纳水中，鱼吞即死浮出，人取食之无妨。莽草字亦作 （音罔）字，今俗呼为 草也。臣禹锡等谨按尔雅云∶ ，春草。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-l4ycakr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-l4ycakr","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"释曰∶药草也，今俗呼为 草。郭云∶一名芒草者，所见本异也。药性论云∶ 草，臣。能治为末，鸡子白调如糊， 毒肿，干即更易上。日华子云∶治皮肤麻痹，并浓煎汤淋，风 牙痛图经曰∶莽草，亦曰 草。出上谷及冤句，今南中州郡及蜀川皆有之。木若石南而叶稀，无花实。五月、七月采叶，阴干。一说∶藤生，绕木石间。古方∶治风毒痹厥诸酒，皆用 草。今含少顷间吐之，以治牙齿风甚效。此木也。而《尔雅·释草》云∶ ，春草。释曰∶药草，莽草也。郭璞云∶一名芒草， 音近故尔。然谓之草者，乃蔓生者是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-y99cfju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-y99cfju","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本余治难产。雷公云∶凡使，采得后便取叶细锉，又，生甘草、水蓼二味并细锉之，用生稀绢袋盛毒木叶，于甑中上，甘草、水蓼同蒸一日，去诸药二件，取出晒干用之。勿用尖有孪生者。圣惠方∶治牙齿孔，疼痛及有虫。用草为末，绵裹纳 孔中，或于痛处咬之，低头吐津勿咽之，疼痛便定。又方∶治瘰 发肿而坚结成核。用 草一两为末，鸡子白和敷于帛上，贴之，日二易之，便瘥。肘后方∶治痈疮未溃。 草末，鸡子白涂纸浓粘贴，燥复易，得痛良。又风齿疼，颊肿。用五两，水一斗煮取五升，热含漱吐之，一日尽。梅师方∶治齿肿痛。 草、郁李仁各四两，水六升，煎取二升，去滓，热含冷吐。周礼翦氏掌除蠹物，以 草熏之则死。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-kgf5bqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-kgf5bqs","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶莽草，今人呼为 草。浓煎汤，淋渫皮肤麻痹。《本经》一名春草。诸家皆谓为草，今居木部，《图经》亦然。今世所用者，皆木叶也。如石南，枝、梗干则绉，揉之，其嗅如椒。《尔雅·释草》云∶，春草。释曰∶今莽草也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132924-patc76h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132924-patc76h","updated":"20240613132924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与《本经》合，今当具言之。石南条中，陶隐居注云∶似 草，凌冬不凋。诚木无疑。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132951-c8j5gnl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132951-c8j5gnl"}},{"ID":"20240613132952-o3y37em","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132952-o3y37em","updated":"20240613132958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132952-lw6041e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132952-lw6041e","updated":"20240613133001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛苦，温，有毒。主风头痈肿，乳痈疝瘕，除结气疥瘙。杀虫鱼。 喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒。可用沐，勿令入眼。一名弭，一名春草。生上谷山谷及冤句，五月采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133051-reyl6xi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133051-reyl6xi"}},{"ID":"20240613133052-av156y1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133052-av156y1","updated":"20240613133057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133052-n9da62o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133052-n9da62o","updated":"20240613133052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，有毒．主治喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒，可用沐，勿近目．一名 ，一名春草．生上谷及宛朐．五月采叶，阴干．"}]},{"ID":"20240613133052-lk8h2y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133052-lk8h2y1","updated":"20240613133052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶莽草，味辛，温．主风头痈肿，乳痈疝瘕，除结气疥瘙，杀虫鱼．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240613133212-hjhcwbi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133212-hjhcwbi"}},{"ID":"20240613133213-zjse44k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133213-zjse44k","updated":"20240613133218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133213-84k3odl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133213-84k3odl","updated":"20240613133213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦微温，祛风胜湿，煎沐头风、疝瘕。不入汤剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133329-wadg770","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133329-wadg770"}},{"ID":"20240613133330-thildof","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133330-thildof","updated":"20240613133334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133330-btq3omj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133330-btq3omj","updated":"20240613133330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人呼为 草。浓煎汤，淋渫皮肤麻痹。《本经》一名春草。诸家皆谓为草，今居木部，《图经》亦然。今世所用者，皆木叶也。如石楠，枝、梗干则绉，揉之，其嗅如椒。《尔雅·释草》云∶“ ，春草。释曰∶今莽草也”。与《本经》合，今当具言之。石楠条中，陶隐居注云∶“似 草，凌冬不凋。”诚木无疑。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133243-re9jr32","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133243-re9jr32"}},{"ID":"20240613133245-qlo6ypb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133245-qlo6ypb","updated":"20240613133249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133245-gvz7aix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133245-gvz7aix","updated":"20240613133245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、苦，温，有毒。主治风头，痈肿，乳痈，疝瘕，除结气，疥瘙，虫疽疮。杀虫鱼。治喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒，可用沐，勿近目。一名 ，一名春草。生上谷山谷及宛朐。五月采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133245-4crw4pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133245-4crw4pd","updated":"20240613133324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上谷远在幽州，今东间诸山处处皆有。叶青新烈者良。人用捣以和米纳水中，鱼吞即死浮出，人取食之无妨。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133232-6ypejfq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133232-6ypejfq"}},{"ID":"20240613133233-gb51ot8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133233-gb51ot8","updated":"20240613133237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133233-02ps223","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133233-02ps223","updated":"20240613133233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十三"}]},{"ID":"20240613133233-cv1kfer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133233-cv1kfer","updated":"20240613133233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名春草。神农∶辛。雷公、桐君∶苦，有毒。生上谷山中，或宛句。五月采。治风。"}]},{"ID":"20240613133222-olwfqtv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133222-olwfqtv"}},{"ID":"20240613133223-xm34wu0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133223-xm34wu0","updated":"20240613133227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133223-cvhpelf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133223-cvhpelf","updated":"20240613133223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"宣、去风湿．"}]},{"ID":"20240613133223-6uo721w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133223-6uo721w","updated":"20240613133223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦而温．治头风痈肿．乳痈疝瘕．（苏颂曰∶古方风湿诸酒多用之、今人取叶煎汤、热含、治牙虫喉痹甚效、甄权曰∶不入汤．）取叶细锉．以生甘草、水蓼二味同盛．入生稀绢袋曝干．（圣惠方、治头风久痛、莽草煎汤沐之、勿令入目．）"}]},{"ID":"20240613133114-w8z1uz6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613133114-w8z1uz6"}},{"ID":"20240613133115-hu23nex","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613133115-hu23nex","updated":"20240613133120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240613133135-u649o1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133135-u649o1l","updated":"20240613133138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名䒽草。诸家皆谓之草，而《本草》居木部。今世所用皆木叶，如石南。不作花实，枝硬，干则诌（音炒。相扰也。）。揉之，其臭如椒。五七月采叶，阴干用。（宗奭、颂）"}]},{"ID":"20240613133135-emc3fth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613133135-emc3fth","updated":"20240613133147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛苦温，有毒。主治风头痈肿，乳痈疝瘕，疗风疽疝气，肿坠凝血。治瘰疬，除湿风，皮肤麻痹，浓煎汤淋。不入汤服，外治则无不可。古方治风毒痹厥诸证，皆用䒽草。今医家取叶煎汤，热含少顷，吐之。（颂）　子生数日，两肾缩入，此受寒气而然也。以硫黄、茱萸、大蒜研，涂其腹，更用莽草、蛇床子烧烟，熏其下部即愈。（濒湖）　莽草制雌黄、雄黄而有毒，误食害人，惟紫河车磨水服，及黑豆煮汁服可解。（濒湖）豆汁浇其根即烂，性相制也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132824-c73mvjj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132824-c73mvjj"}},{"ID":"20240613132825-fw8xat0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-fw8xat0","updated":"20240613132829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132825-68syr7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-68syr7d","updated":"20240613132825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名 ，即鼠莽，本作茧字，此物有毒，食之令人迷罔故名。山人以之毒鼠，"}]},{"ID":"20240613132825-v0r7thc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-v0r7thc","updated":"20240613132825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"渔人以之毒鱼，与醉鱼草总一类"}]},{"ID":"20240613132825-zsn5hfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-zsn5hfs","updated":"20240613132825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132825-sjxwveh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-sjxwveh","updated":"20240613132825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主头风痈肿疝瘕，除结气疥瘙，杀虫鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132825-bncl2go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132825-bncl2go","updated":"20240613132825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草大毒，善杀鱼鼠，其性可知。《本经》治疝瘕结气，荡涤在内之宿积也。疗痈肿头风，搜逐在外之邪毒也。但性最猛烈，服之令人瞑眩。《千金方》每与茵芋同为搜风涤恶之峻剂。近世罕能用之。惟毒鱼之外，仅以浴顽痹湿风及煎嗽虫牙，然沐时勿令入眼，中其毒者，惟草紫河车磨水服之可解，黑豆煮汁服之亦解。以豆汁浇莽根则烂，物类之相制如此。至于茵芋人所未识，毋怪近世医术之卑也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132812-lhus8ad","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132812-lhus8ad"}},{"ID":"20240613132813-2dstmjk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132813-2dstmjk","updated":"20240613132818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132813-c8uh6jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132813-c8uh6jp","updated":"20240613132813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、苦，温，有毒。主风头痈肿，乳痈，疝瘕，除结气疥瘙，虫疽疮，杀虫鱼。疗喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒，可用沐，勿近目。一名 ，一名春草。生上谷山谷及宛朐。五月采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132813-xqxxs3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132813-xqxxs3c","updated":"20240613132813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上谷远在幽州，今东间诸山处处皆有。叶青新烈者良。人用捣以和米内水中，鱼吞即死浮出，人取食之无妨。莽草，字亦有作 字，今俗呼为 草也。郁核，味酸，平，无毒。主大腹水肿，面目四肢浮肿，利小便水道。根，主齿龈肿、龋齿，坚齿，去白虫。一名爵李，一名车下李，一名棣。生高山山谷及丘陵上。五月、六月采根。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132813-hhniyvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132813-hhniyvm","updated":"20240613132813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山野处处有，其子熟赤色，亦可啖之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132717-dzbbwet","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132717-dzbbwet"}},{"ID":"20240613132743-72hef9s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-72hef9s","updated":"20240613132752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-47kytui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-47kytui","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」芒草、鼠莽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-l3jwu15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-l3jwu15","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（叶）辛、温、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-4z6xfua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-4z6xfua","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-ivvdldb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-ivvdldb","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、贼风肿痹（风入五脏，恍惚）。用莽草一斤，乌头、附子、踯躅各二两，切细，以水和醋泡一夜。取出，和猪油一斤同煎，去渣，手蘸药汁摩病处几百次，可愈。此法亦治癣疥杂疮。耳鼻疾，可以棉裹药汁塞。此方名“莽草膏”。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-tigaif4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-tigaif4","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿风阐（抽筋、翻眼，重者一天发病数十次）。用莽草、舅丸各一鸡蛋黄大，和猪油一斤同煎，去渣，手蘸药汁摩病处几百次，可愈。此法亦治癣疥杂疮。耳鼻有疾，可以用棉裹药汁塞住。此方名“莽草膏”。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-8r2ku2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-8r2ku2x","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、头风久痛。作莽草煎汤洗头。勿令药汁入目。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-zdczeky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-zdczeky","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、瘰疬结核。用莽草一两，研为末加鸡蛋白调匀，涂布上帜疮。一天换药二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-c7sy6c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-c7sy6c5","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、乳肿不消。用莽草、小豆，等分为末，加苦酒和匀，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132743-pkoyq1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132743-pkoyq1f","updated":"20240613132743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、风虫牙痛及喉痹。用莽草叶煎汤。热时含口中，过一会吐去，很有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132717-8c31koq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132717-8c31koq"}},{"ID":"20240613132718-ctb5mos","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ctb5mos","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：莽草"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-pwj33ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-pwj33ua","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-7owchpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-7owchpf","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mǎnɡ Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-rxm5rxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-rxm5rxd","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-g07dub6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-g07dub6","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芒草（《山海经》），葞、春草（《尔雅》），菵草（陶弘景），石桂、红桂（《梦溪笔谈》），鼠莽（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-64oqc7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-64oqc7e","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-ntcgd8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ntcgd8i","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-c5eh3lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-c5eh3lh","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-3xai2b9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-3xai2b9","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为本兰科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"狭叶茴香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-dgp1r80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-dgp1r80","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-uyrtlvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-uyrtlvf","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使（莽草），采得后，便取叶细锉。又生甘草、水蓼二味，并细锉之，用生稀绢袋盛毒木叶于甑中，上甘草、水蓼同蒸-日，去诸药二件，取出，晒干用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-9pgcaeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-9pgcaeg","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-cqsntd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-cqsntd0","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-42r9fol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-42r9fol","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-d83318x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-d83318x","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"雷公、桐君，苦，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-bll6uuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-bll6uuq","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求原》：\"甘，温，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-thrjt1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-thrjt1e","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-609kk0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-609kk0f","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风、消肿。治头风，痈肿，皮肤麻痹，瘰疬，乳痈，喉痹，疝瘕，癣疥，秃疮，风虫牙痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-5cd3q2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-5cd3q2l","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主头风，痈肿，乳肿（一作乳痈），疝瘕，除结气，疥瘙。杀虫鱼。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-j76q6za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-j76q6za","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒，可用沐，勿近目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-jrwkrsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-jrwkrsa","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"能治风疽，疝气肿坠，凝血，治瘰疬，除湿风。不入汤服。主头疮白秃，杀虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-ohzqf54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ohzqf54","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《唐本草》：\"治难产。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-mbn613y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-mbn613y","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"治皮肤麻痹，并浓煎汤淋。风虫牙痛，喉痹，亦浓煎叶，含后净漱口。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-3xof7hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-3xof7hn","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-gyamtrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-gyamtrq","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末调敷、煎水洗或含漱。不可内服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-pysbf25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-pysbf25","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-w9dozi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-w9dozi0","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治头风久痛：莽草煎汤沐之，勿令入目。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-117gh1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-117gh1q","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治痈未溃：莽草末，和鸡子白，涂纸令厚，贴上，燥复易，得痛自瘥，（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-kboqr6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-kboqr6i","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后乳痈，初得令消：赤小豆、莽草。上等分为末，苦酒和敷之。（《经效产宝》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-px7qf3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-px7qf3m","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治毒肿：莽草、白蔹、赤小豆。为末，鸡子白调如糊，熁，干即更易上。（《药性论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-qr5bde8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-qr5bde8","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治瘰疬，发肿而坚，结成核：莽草一两。捣罗为末，以鸡子白和涂于帛上贴之，一日二易。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-kh34ol9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-kh34ol9","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治诸贼风，肿痹，风入五脏，恍惚，并治疥癣杂疮：莽草一斤，乌头、附子、踯躅各三两。四物切，以水和苦酒一升，溃一宿，猪脂四斤，煎，三上三下，绞去滓，向火以手摩病上三百度。耳鼻病，可以绵裹塞之。（《补缺肘后方》莽草膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-8bcr7uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-8bcr7uu","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治风齿疼，颊肿：莽草五两，水一斗，煮取五升，热含漱吐之，一日尽。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-upcv4t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-upcv4t5","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治牙齿蚛孔，疼痛不可忍，兼有虫：莽草搀罗为末，以绵裹纳蚛孔中，或于痛处咬之，低头吐津，勿咽之，其疼痛便定。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-d23j78c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-d23j78c","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治小儿风痫，掣疭戴眼，极者日数十发。又治大人赋风：莽草、雷丸各一鸡子黄大。化猪脂一斤，煎七沸，去滓摩痛处，勿近目及阴，日凡三四次。（《外台》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-fyk2o8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-fyk2o8m","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治狗咬昏闷：浸椒水，调莽草末敷之。（《便民图纂》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-t47ms7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-t47ms7i","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-qkqlp45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-qkqlp45","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草述》：\"莽草与金牙石，在颤振、谵妄二证胥投之，此愚所谓于气血精微之用，的有相须者也，第难与金牙石例论，为其有毒耳。时珍之说甚明，不得尝试，外治则无不可也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-76qco99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-76qco99","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"莽草大毒，善杀鱼、鼠，其性可知。《本经》治疝瘕结气，荡涤在内之宿积也；疗痈肿头风，搜逐在外之邪毒也。但性最猛烈，服之令人瞑眩。《千金方》每与茵芋同为搜风涤恶之峻剂，近世罕能用之，惟毒鱼之外，仅以浴顽痹湿风及煎漱虫牙，然沐时勿令入眼。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-5yndigv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-5yndigv","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-67h364b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-67h364b","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-uaaddq4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-uaaddq4","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：莽草"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-ju4t33h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ju4t33h","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-eghcnp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-eghcnp9","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mǎnɡ Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-rwhe0v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-rwhe0v0","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-looty7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-looty7k","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芒草、葞、春草、（艹网）草、石佳、红桂、鼠莽、红茴香、骨底搜、山木蟹、山大茴"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-e09mvsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-e09mvsn","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-gpi97l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-gpi97l6","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-azjgzji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-azjgzji","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《山海经》：葌山，其下多青雄黄，有木焉，其状如棠而赤叶，名曰莽草，可以毒鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-fokzvyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-fokzvyp","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《范子计然》：莽草出三辅，青色者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-424sm21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-424sm21","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《吴普本草》：(莽草)生上谷山中或冤句，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-exjwfer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-exjwfer","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草图经》：莽草，今南中州郡及蜀川皆有之。木若石南而叶稀，无花实。五月、七月间采叶阴干。一说藤生，绕木石间。古方治风毒痹厥诸酒，皆用WANG草。今医家取其叶，煎汤热含，少"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-fgwdp1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-fgwdp1x","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-qi61mpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-qi61mpt","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为八角科植物狭叶茴香的叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-ijwbv7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ijwbv7i","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Illicium lanceolatum A.C.Smith"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-wbny5gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-wbny5gp","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏两季采摘，鲜用或晒干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-x0jif1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-x0jif1q","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-t70k36x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-t70k36x","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于沿河两岸，阴湿沟谷两旁的混交林或疏林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-c0dllud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-c0dllud","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于陕西、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-m4flvfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-m4flvfp","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-5irje52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-5irje52","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 常绿灌木或小乔木，高3-10m。树皮、老枝灰褐色。单叶互生或集生；叶柄长7-15mm；叶革质，披针形、倒披针形或椭圆形，长6-15cm，宽1.5-4.5cm，先端尾尖或渐尖，基部窄楔形，全缘。边缘稍反卷，无毛，上面绿色，有光泽，下面淡绿色。花腋生或近顶生，单生或2-3朵集生叶腋；花梗长1.5-5cm;花被片10-15，红色至深红色，最大一片长7-12mm，宽5-8mm；雄蕊6-11；心皮10-13，长3.9-5.3mm，花柱直立，钻形，长2-3.3mm。果柄长5.5cm，稀可达8cm；（艹骨）（艹突）果10-13，木质，先端有长而弯曲的尖头。种子淡褐色，长7-7.5mm，宽5mm。花期5-6月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-ppo7odo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-ppo7odo","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-desiq41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-desiq41","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品平者多皱缩或破碎。完整者展平后为披针形、倒披针形或椭圆形，长6-15cm，宽1．5-4.5cm，基部窄楔形，边缘微反卷；两面绿色，下面稍淡；叶柄长7-15mm。气香烈，味辛，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-gj8eret","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-gj8eret","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-nyjjph0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-nyjjph0","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 枝、叶、根、果均有毒，果实，尤其是果壳(艹骨)（艹突）毒性大。莽草中毒多因将其果误作八角食用而引起。其毒害作用为直接刺激消化道粘膜，经消化道吸收进入间脑、延脑，使呼吸中枢和血管运动中枢功能失常，井麻痹运动神经末梢，严重时损害大脑。中毒症状类似癫痫，主要是惊厥，尚有精神作用，临床表现为有恶心、呕吐、口渴、腹泻、头痛、眩晕、狂躁不安、幻视、心律失常、四肢麻木、呼吸急促、严重者昏迷、谚语、四肢抽搐或阵发性惊厥、尿少至尿闭，死于呼吸衰竭[1-3]。尸检见指甲青紫，面部及枕部皮下出血，脑、心、肝和肾充血[4]。莽草慢性中毒的特点是发病缓慢，无胃肠道症状，均以失眠开始，有头昏、精神不振、全身无力、惊慌不安。幻听幻视、胡言乱语、阵发性惊厥、全身虫爬感、四肢不自主的抽搐以及神志不清[5]。狗、猫、小鼠等动物的中毒症状与人相似，尸检发现：狗肺部有出血性梗塞、浮肿、浆液膜下溢血和肾、胃、肝、脑瘀血，小鼠血液暗红。小鼠腹腔注射的LD50：果实0.7g/kg，果皮o．5g/kg，种子2．17g/kg，叶4．6g／kg，茎皮5．1g/kg；皮下注射的LD50:果实0．66g／kg；静脉注射的LD50:果实0．425g／kg。果实水浸剂或种子粉剂对猫和狗灌胃致死量（LD）均为0．4g／kg，果实对小鼠半数惊厥量（CD50）为0．813g／kg[2,6]。人服种子5～8粒可中毒。莽草的毒理作用与印防已毒素相似，是一种痉挛毒，作用部位在脑干的延脑部分，主要中毒症状是痉挛，其次有恶心、呕吐、大小便失禁等一系列自主神经系统症状；但莽草素中毒的潜伏期和持续时间都比印防己毒素长，对巴比妥钠有良好拮抗作用[3，7]。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-mysdzvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-mysdzvj","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-lhazozv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-lhazozv","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：凡使(莽草)，采得后，便取叶细锉。又生甘草、水蓼二味，并细锉之，用生稀绢袋盛毒木叶于甑中，上甘草、水蓼同蒸一日，去诸药二件，取出，晒干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-okiva15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-okiva15","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-nnyh2ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-nnyh2ps","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；性温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-o5exbzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-o5exbzu","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-v16ikpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-v16ikpu","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风止痛；消肿散结；杀虫止痒。主头风；皮肤麻痹；痈肿；乳痈；瘰疬；喉痹；疝瘕；癣疥；秃疮；风虫牙痛；狐臭"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-7xfmati","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-7xfmati","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-crluxyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-crluxyt","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：适量，捣敷；研未调敷；或煎水熏洗、含漱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-5y5fkf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-5y5fkf7","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-arbops5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-arbops5","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治头风久痛：莽草煎汤沐之，勿令入目。(《圣惠方》)②治痈未溃：莽草末，和鸡子白，涂纸令厚，贴上，燥复易，得痛自瘥。(《补缺肘后方》)③治产后乳痈，初得令消：赤小豆、莽草。上等分为末，苦酒和敷之。(《经效产宝》)④治毒肿：莽草、白蔹、赤小豆。为末，鸡子白调如糊，熁，干即更易上。(《药性论》)⑤治瘰疬，发肿而坚，结成核：莽草一两。捣罗为末，以鸡子白和涂于帛上贴之，一日二易。(《圣惠方》)⑥治诸贼风，肿痹，风入五脏。恍惚，并治疥癣杂疮：莽草一斤，乌头、附子、踯躅各三两。四物切，以水和苦酒一升，渍一宿，猪脂四斤，煎，三上三下，绞去滓，向火以手摩病上三百度。耳鼻病，可以绵裹塞之。(《补缺肘后方》莽草膏)⑦治风齿疼，颊肿：莽草五两，水一斗，煮取五升，热含漱吐之，一日尽。(《补缺肘后方》)⑧治牙齿蚛孔，疼痛不可忍，兼有虫：莽草捣罗为末，以绵裹纳蚛孔中，或于痛处咬之，低头吐津，勿咽之，其疼痛便定。(《圣惠方》)⑨治小儿风痫，掣瘲戴眼，极者日数十发。又治大人贼风：莽草、雷丸各一鸡子黄大。化猪脂一斤，煎七沸，去滓摩痛处，勿近目及阴，日凡三四次。(《外台》)⑩治狗咬昏闷：浸椒水，调莽草末敷之。(《便民图纂》)"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-atgmdf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-atgmdf6","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-hna3mep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-hna3mep","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》；主头风，痈肿，乳肿(一作乳痈)，疝瘕，除结气，疥瘙。杀虫鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-oflnjnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-oflnjnm","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：疗喉痹不通，乳难，头风痒， 可用沐，勿近目。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-3bsskx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-3bsskx2","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》： 能治风疽，疝气肿坠，凝血，治瘰疬，除湿风。不入汤服。主头疮白秃，杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-6xd91xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-6xd91xo","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《唐本草》：治难产。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-0uf7521","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-0uf7521","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》： 治皮肤麻痹，并浓煎汤琳。风虫牙痛，喉痹，亦浓煎叶，含后净漱口。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-7spcy0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-7spcy0q","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草述》：莽草与金牙石，在颤振、谵妄二证胥投之，此愚所谓于气血精微之用，的有相须者也，第难与金牙石例论，为其有毒耳。时珍之说甚明，不得尝试，外治则无不可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-9vtdnc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-9vtdnc8","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本经逢原》：莽草大毒，善杀鱼、鼠，其性可知。《本经》治疝瘕结气，荡涤在内之宿积也；疗痈肿头风，搜逐在外之邪毒也。但性最猛烈；服之令入瞑眩。《千金方》每与茵芋同为搜风涤恶之峻剂，近世罕能用之，惟毒鱼之外，仅以浴顽痹湿风及煎漱虫牙，然沐时勿令入眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-y5djy5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-y5djy5f","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613132718-h1dnxqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132718-h1dnxqf","updated":"20240613132718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613132720-53815wk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613132720-53815wk"}},{"ID":"20240613132721-6qqk0ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613132721-6qqk0ip"}}]}